<title>UK: Council of Europe sets 1.3 bln Ffr structured bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets 1.3 bln Ffr structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    1.3 BLN FFR   COUPON   **4.6	 MATURITY    20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE   TEC10 LINKED  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR YEARS 1-5, THEN TEC10 MINUS 96 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
